{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1QfCUV7phTCNBs99gXuP8w","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:26.402054+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1QfCUV7phTCNBs99gXuP8w","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iadGcHegc7t1oCcnW18WtpxpWlM6KT50hOfzemwRf3EW1GGcsYibLjibaUbmzCjv959CZ0k99Q966jnFKnHerS4J9GErTQic7dXj3mKyPicslVbw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2CYAdzl5BpnTXzECgbDbQ7OZeQwTuhiaKNF1tPsePAFbowvo5M1EZ5MtBXL500bIVuLG7g0UVKd18FUeHBGafzibneON1yt0gxM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2mpWLqYiaG7ptSCuh3tEYa7rnDias0uxtewibmxNo3Ub2VZcypiaXCkhe5B1zficDKjicaddnLiaFIGe6S6Aej48IElCsr8sSkqV2DQg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>瞬态物理全国重点实验室</span></strong></span><span>依托南京理工大学建设，为1991年国防科工委在全国首批批准立项建设的两个国家级重点实验室之一，1995年投入运行。2023年顺利通过重组，获批全国重点实验室，面向我国装备发展重大需求开展科学研究工作，并形成“一室两部三基地”的发展格局，为我国弹道学人才培养的摇篮和对外交流的窗口。实验室位于南京理工大学南京钟山校区，属于学校教学科研机构。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/iadGcHegc7t3BdcPickDnsBuE6nxOrX4ynNibQO2VMUyzYOBAzEO91BjCjfPuKE548WJrKxZJAP7yOQSyYYupE2xXiaxXO34PVEkX0IdXMlh0R4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>瞬态物理全国重点实验室具有一支富有开拓创新精神的高水平科研队伍。现有教职工</span><strong><em><span><span>203</span></span></em></strong><span>人，其中高级职称教师</span><span><em><strong><span>143</span></strong></em></span><span>人，具有博士学位比例</span><strong><em><span><span>77%</span></span></em></strong><span>。兵器、航天、中科院等兼职导师</span><strong><em><span><span>5</span></span></em></strong><span>人，企业导师</span><strong><em><span><span>27</span></span></em></strong><span>人。中国工程院院士</span><strong><em><span><span>3</span></span></em></strong><span>人，国家级领军人才</span><strong><em><span><span>5</span></span></em></strong><span>人，中国科协青托1人，江苏省“333高层次人才工程”</span><strong><em><span><span>6</span></span></em></strong><span>人，江苏省“六大人才高峰”</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>人，江苏省科协青托</span><strong><em><span><span>3</span></span></em></strong><span>人，海外优青</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人，南京理工大学青年教授</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>人。</span></p><p><span>博士招生学科：兵器科学与技术、力学、动力工程及工程热物理、机械（工程博士）。硕士招生学科：兵器科学与技术、力学、动力工程及工程热物理、测试计量仪器与技术、兵器工程（专业学位）、动力工程（专业学位）。其中兵器科学与技术为国家重点学科、国家一流学科，兵器发射理论与技术为国防特色学科，工程热物理为江苏省重点学科，测控技术与仪器为江苏省品牌专业。</span></p><p><span>重点实验室研究生就业层次较高，多集中在高校、科研机构、国防重点单位以及大中型国有企业、上市公司（如华为）等，包括兵器、航天、航空、船舶、电子等行业，就业地域遍布全国经济或技术发达地区。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2UrsGGQl4BxLvIGp2FmDZjnhxKTLYiaC24F2pBPY2965libNic8LObQ5aaVzgDibFaFZSQAPtB0Btiav8AM0ufHJJo6EE2KbjuGia18/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0ZicTKzqPia6hcaPHVym5aQnFNN58SGVHAFk3DuD0YWkPAXStX7FcJEkYxwHcKg1Rzc2Jj0LEokmLia0OLygpvcXibr7ib7pqibuUJw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>50人左右</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2026年</span><span><strong><span>7月1日—8月10日</span></strong></span><span>（不在时间范围内的申请无效）。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>该部分内容应包括对报名人员的专业、成绩、品德、心理等方面的要求，可参考如下内容：</span></p><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2027年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好（四六级成绩或其他资格考试证明）；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业为工程力学、流体力学、机械工程、武器系统与工程、弹药工程与爆炸技术、控制工程及相近专业，具有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>5</span></strong></span><strong><span>.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，实验室根据学科特点、开放日规模，选择一定数量学生参加开放日活动，并通过</span><span><strong><span>邮件</span></strong></span><span>方式进行通知。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请人在</span><span><strong><span>8月12日上午8:00</span></strong></span><span>前将下列材料</span><span><strong><span>按顺序</span></strong></span><span>扫描，合并为一个pdf，发送至联系邮箱：yz121@njust.edu.cn，邮件主题命名格式为：</span><span><strong><span>“姓名-本科院校-本科专业-联系方式”。</span></strong></span></p><p><span>（1）校园开放日活动申请表（研究生院报名系统中导出，信息填写完备）；</span></p><p><span>（2）本人居民身份证或学生证复印件；</span></p><p><span>（3）本科阶段历年成绩单与专业总评成绩排名证明（须加盖教务处或院系</span><strong><span><span>公章</span></span></strong><span>）；</span></p><p><span>（4）外语水平证明（如CET-4、CET-6、TOEFL、IELTS等的证书或成绩单）；</span></p><p><span>（5）其它能证明本人成绩及潜力的材料，如校级及以上获奖证书、公开发表的学术论文、资格证书等复印件。</span></p><p><span>所提交的材料必须保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，将取消申请资格。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1Ox6Zsbhia5ahjYg9XNtknnxd72I1XuKX3Kb1iboTQCQ95FANHVianhNvPKzkNBiaDiarCnf0hWcnTpVI2icQTsGic3R2K2tgYrG5Tcw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>马老师</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>联系电话</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>025-84315652</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>电子邮箱</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>yz121@njust.edu.cn</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名人员加群（QQ）</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3DHNzlqbibyXfTcowDtmkxibtjc73SM1C9VPn8rJPicZczK5tCD6w4jDyONYciacic1VfU0LgCSoHU2icI8x3M1ufMMBTDkJgF7CT30/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>566191743</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3lZNN6Wvnb4F3xOHy68QuokmyIkBt3eUHGAPduktnlTcibAW8X00enOwA4OFiaZBicpicI4jVTFiaic91DheMpS7TuVsPPuVhiafOgFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>出品 | 南京理工大学研招办</span></p><p><span>来源 | 瞬态物理全国重点实验室</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 吴雅琪</span></p><p><span>初审 | 秦俊华 瞬态物理全国重点实验室</span></p><p><span>审核 | 于雷</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2J0WJNcvp782yh0rzXWak6Fxa4gprnTicucmUG256CH9iamYxQgHkzNxJLMoT6ELOLzVPibDe9dQh51Q9x2XWSpiapa6uud4z6RIQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"8ec410c978896fbb0c03fc868aaff44e6eabcf4b5b3096178e6e5f77df705019","textLength":1491,"sourceSha256":"7a630d6b57aa6d94b834aca023e0fe608d33483fbcc86965af1fdf803c8f6332","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-1ccaf36abc8e680041c5","title":"2026年南京理工大学瞬态物理全国重点实验室2026年全国“优秀大学生”校园开放日活动公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:26.402054+00:00"}
